--- a/native/ARCHITECTURE.md
+++ b/native/ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -21,7 +21,13 @@
 | Reminders | Serialized scheduling, revision checks, permission feedback and wake/activation reconciliation | `ReminderService.swift`, `ReminderLifecycle.swift` |
 | Preferences and policy | Shared local theme, board placement, robot-home, previews and Auto Capture settings; accessible bundled privacy information | `ThemeSettings.swift`, `RobotPlacementSettings.swift`, `AutoCaptureSettings.swift`, `PrivacyInformation.swift`, `Resources/` |
 
-The Xcode navigator groups these boundaries. Sources remain in one flat directory so the portable build and Xcode inventory use the same files.
+The shared inventory recursively discovers production Swift files under `Sources/DaBin`. The Xcode navigator uses fixed layer groups; `State/` maps to State and Domain, `Storage/` to Storage, and `Interface/Workspace/` and `Interface/Tutorial/` to Interface. Existing entry points and facades keep their flat paths for tools and source-policy checks. These directories remain one Swift module and add no package dependencies.
+
+Collaborators follow ownership rather than file size. `AppState` remains the observable presentation facade while `State/AppDraftSession.swift` owns draft identity, subscriptions, debounce scheduling and recovery persistence. `CaptureDraft` and `NewTaskDraft` hold edit state, `ChecklistDraftPolicy` handles checklist transitions, and `CaptureTimelinePresentationCache` owns bounded day/week projections. `CaptureStore` remains the canonical model, metadata and publication owner. `Storage/CaptureImportJournalService.swift` handles durable staging, byte verification, journals and interrupted-import recovery; `Storage/CaptureArchiveMaintenance.swift` handles repair scheduling, generation cancellation and repair-failure state. Storage collaborators report outcomes to the store so persistence and publication retain their established order.
+
+Workspace view composition lives in `ProjectWorkspaceBrowser` and the content/row types under `Interface/Workspace/`. `ProjectWorkspaceBrowserActions` owns selection and browser commands; `ProjectWorkspaceNativeTable` owns native hosting and row refresh, and `WorkspaceZoomViewport` owns viewport anchors and zoom restoration. `DaBinTutorialController` and its overlay, targets and stage layout live under `Interface/Tutorial/`. Queued native updates retain their generation and readiness guards; extraction must preserve focus, row reuse, selection and measurement boundaries. Internal helper types keep those responsibilities local without expanding the public facade API.
+
+Source filenames are unique across the entire source tree, including case variants, because compiler products use filenames. Runtime resources retain explicit registration and unique filenames because portable bundles and Xcode flatten resource paths. Shared discovery and fingerprints cover nested sources; an added or edited collaborator invalidates the production QA module cache. Standalone suites stay flat under `Tests/` and are registered in `scripts/run_qa.py`, while the XCTest target continues to compile only its smoke test.
 
